<p>Your inner flame is strong. Each time that you receive a blow that would kill you, your body is wreathed in flames.</p><p>The flames will cauterize the wound, fully absorbing all damage done this turn, but they will continue to burn for 8 turns.</p><p>Each turn 10% of the damage absorbed will be dealt by the flames. This will bypass resistance and affinity.</p><p>Warning: this has a cooldown.</p>